  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Depression in freezing point,<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#916;T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>iK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></msub><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>ix</mi><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>86</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>93</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>33</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>%</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>80</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the percentage association of solute A in water is 80.</p>",
